# M B005 — rules/testing.md, scripts/check-instructions.mjs, scripts/check-manifests.mjs (part)
1 CO TST-001 m=D | Restates TST-001 (an established project keeping another deliberate framework is the 'concrete reason' case).
2 CO TST-002 m=D | Restates TST-002.
