6 XP m=D c=M rel=TST-005,TST-003 | testing.md:47-48 'Prefer one observable scenario per test; a multi-step test fits when the sequence itself is the behavior': TST-005 concerns explicit cases vs generated machinery, not scenarios per test.
  e: a multi-step test when the sequence itself is the behavior
  s: One test asserting create, rename and delete outcomes of unrelated features is allowed by the oracle; M's default prefers one scenario per test.
7 CO TST-005 m=D | Restates TST-005 (replica wording).
8 CO TST-004 | Restates TST-004; using TimeProvider against wall-clock timing and never connecting tests to Production data are parts of determinism and isolation.
