12 CO TST-012 m=D | Restates TST-012.
13 CD TST-012 m=D k=P c=M | TST-012 requires descriptive names; testing.md:73-75 adds a default pattern MethodOrScenario_Condition_ExpectedBehavior unless the project has an established convention.
  e: unless the project already has an established convention
  x: default naming pattern MethodOrScenario_Condition_ExpectedBehavior
  s: A descriptive name such as Returns404WhenOrderDoesNotExist satisfies TST-012; M's default prescribes the underscore three-part pattern.
14 IA m=M | check-instructions: skill folder shape (SKILL.md plus optional Markdown references).
15 IA m=M | check-instructions: code-reviewer stays a thin wrapper.
16 IA m=M | check-instructions: required instruction/product-input files must exist.
17 IA m=M | check-instructions: required workflow/knowledge skill set; serilog/resilience skills forbidden.
18 IA m=M | check-instructions: CLAUDE.md imports only docs/technology-stack.md; no other @ imports.
