20 IA m=S | check-instructions: warning when the always-loaded estimate exceeds ~6000 tokens (warning only).
21 IA m=M | check-instructions: required hook registrations in settings.json (enforcement wiring of the instruction system).
22 IA m=M fa=FC c=M | Facet: required registrations must sit in one group whose matcher covers every tool; describes the checker's existing acceptance boundary (no agent or product obligation; instruction-configuration constraint only).
23 IA m=M | check-instructions: agents are single Markdown files; skill folders hold SKILL.md and Markdown references only.
24 IA m=MN | check-instructions: no Level:/Kind: classification lines.
25 IA m=M | check-instructions: .claude/rules flat, Markdown only, non-empty paths list.
26 IA m=M fa=FC c=M | Facet: paths accepted only as a YAML block sequence; describes the checker's parser boundary; constraint on instruction files only.
27 IA m=M | check-instructions: skill frontmatter name/description rules; template-maintenance user-only.
28 IA m=M c=M rel=WF-010 | check-instructions fails unless code-reviewer disallows Write/Edit and delegates to code-review: integrity check of the instruction files that implement WF-010, not a duty on review behavior itself.
29 IA m=M | check-instructions: code-reviewer body <= 1500 characters.
